    {
      "id": "u_53598648ed218b4dc2dea583_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To move back and forward in the history of viewed notes, press __TRILIUM_PH_0__Alt__TRILIUM_PH_1__+__TRILIUM_PH_2__←__TRILIUM_PH_3__ and __TRILIUM_PH_4__Alt__TRILIUM_PH_5__+__TRILIUM_PH_6__→__TRILIUM_PH_7__, or use the __TRILIUM_PH_8__ and __TRILIUM_PH_9__ buttons to the left of the __TRILIUM_PH_10__Tabs__TRILIUM_PH_11__.",
      "sourceHash": "53598648ed218b4dc2dea583ab61b30473d7b3a826b10e227c580d29f129d0ea",
      "context": "Note Navigation > Backwards and forward",
      "contextHash": "dcd8c20e6d6ecd8bc7b2fdee8dba63cf98926108f3f4075ad92206d2bb077510",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_16c1e52039f3b4c646760df8_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "This works identically to browser backwards / forwards, it's actually using built-in browser support for this.",
      "sourceHash": "16c1e52039f3b4c646760df8eba6973f14804da2ccb6cc0db17ce3e70268b66b",
      "context": "Note Navigation > Backwards and forward",
      "contextHash": "dcd8c20e6d6ecd8bc7b2fdee8dba63cf98926108f3f4075ad92206d2bb077510",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_d9295771245d648978418c51_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To go several notes back or forward at once, right-click one of the buttons or press and hold it. The back button lists the notes before the current one and the forward button the notes after it, the nearest first. Each entry shows the note's title, with the path of its parent notes at the end of the row. Selecting a note goes straight to it.",
      "sourceHash": "d9295771245d648978418c51dfa13996e6e8a213ffbedfc9e633d8ef8e3c0630",
      "context": "Note Navigation > Backwards and forward",
      "contextHash": "dcd8c20e6d6ecd8bc7b2fdee8dba63cf98926108f3f4075ad92206d2bb077510",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4f383ac9747aef0ed34518e1_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The __TRILIUM_PH_0__Go to Previous Note__TRILIUM_PH_1__ and __TRILIUM_PH_2__Go to Next Note__TRILIUM_PH_3__ launchers of the __TRILIUM_PH_4__Launch Bar__TRILIUM_PH_5__ list the same notes, below the launch bar's own items.",
      "sourceHash": "4f383ac9747aef0ed34518e167e1f96ff9e042484f48c218b48ac73b5b222903",
      "context": "Note Navigation > Backwards and forward",
      "contextHash": "dcd8c20e6d6ecd8bc7b2fdee8dba63cf98926108f3f4075ad92206d2bb077510",
