      "kind": "p",
      "source": "This is useful to quickly find and view arbitrary notes - click on __TRILIUM_PH_0__ button on the top or press __TRILIUM_PH_1__Ctrl__TRILIUM_PH_2__ + __TRILIUM_PH_3__J__TRILIUM_PH_4__ . Then type part of the note name and autocomplete will help you pick the desired note.",
